{"name":"Gheldaneth","status":"ok","title":"Gheldaneth","pageId":36514,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\">\n\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Maps_of_Gheldaneth\" title=\"Category:Maps of Gheldaneth\">Gallery</a></nav>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Gheldaneth</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p185_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p185-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">City</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Menesankh\" title=\"Menesankh\">Menesankh</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mulhorand\" title=\"Mulhorand\">Mulhorand</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/East_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"East Faerûn\">east Faerûn</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Metropolis</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p18_3-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p18-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Humans</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Mulan\" title=\"Mulan\">Mulan</a>), <a href=\"/wiki/Tiefling\" title=\"Tiefling\">tieflings</a><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p139_2-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p139-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"religion\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Religions</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Horus-Re\" title=\"Horus-Re\">Horus-Re</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Isis\" title=\"Isis\">Isis</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Nephthys\" title=\"Nephthys\">Nephthys</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Thoth\" title=\"Thoth\">Thoth</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Commerce<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p17_4-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p17-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"imports\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Imports</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Foodstuffs, misc goods</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Politics<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p20_5-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p20-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"government\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Preceptual government</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rulertype\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler's type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Precept</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"allegiances\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Allegiances</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2h1cmNoX29mX1Rob3RoP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Church of Thoth (page does not exist)\">Church of Thoth</span><br/><a href=\"/wiki/High_Imaskar\" title=\"High Imaskar\">High Imaskar</a><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p139_2-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p139-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p185_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p185-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p139_2-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p139-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p18_3-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p18-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">80,000 in <a href=\"/wiki/1357_DR\" title=\"1357 DR\">1357 DR</a><br/>172,430 in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372 DR</a><br/>22,000 in <a href=\"/wiki/1479_DR\" title=\"1479 DR\">1479 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler1\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Precept</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Derlaunt\" title=\"Derlaunt\">Derlaunt</a> &amp; <a href=\"/wiki/Tholaunt\" title=\"Tholaunt\">Tholaunt</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/1357_DR\" title=\"1357 DR\">1357 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Gheldaneth\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Gheldaneth\">Inhabitants of  Gheldaneth</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Gheldaneth\" title=\"Category:Locations in Gheldaneth\">Locations in  Gheldaneth</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Organizations_in_Gheldaneth\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Gheldaneth\">Organizations in  Gheldaneth</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Gheldaneth</b> was the second largest city in the nation of <a href=\"/wiki/Mulhorand\" title=\"Mulhorand\">Mulhorand</a>,<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p185_1-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p185-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p17_4-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p17-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> as well as one of its sixteen preceptual governments.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p20-21_6-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p20-21-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> It would later come to be the only city in Mulhorand to survive the <a href=\"/wiki/Spellplague\" title=\"Spellplague\">Spellplague</a> after <a href=\"/wiki/1385_DR\" title=\"1385 DR\">1385 DR</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p139_2-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p139-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Description\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Description</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Government\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Government</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trade</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Notable_Locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Locations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Gheldaneth?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n\n<p>This city was situated in the <a href=\"/wiki/Menesankh\" title=\"Menesankh\">Menesankh</a> region of Mulhorand, the southern coast of the <a href=\"/wiki/Alamber_Sea\" title=\"Alamber Sea\">Alamber Sea</a>, where the mouth of the <a href=\"/wiki/River_of_Spears\" title=\"River of Spears\">River of Spears</a> emptied.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p15_7-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p15-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Description\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Gheldaneth?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Description\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Gheldaneth was largely made up of urban sprawl and hosted a large port facility.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p17_4-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p17-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Much of this was destroyed during the Spellplague's upheavel, with its grand buildings becoming buried in rubble, and would be replaced with new buildings.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p139_2-4\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p139-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Government\">Government</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Government\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Gheldaneth?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Government\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Gheldaneth had a preceptual government, which ruled over both the city and the area at the mouth of the River of Spears.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p20-21_6-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p20-21-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> It was largely governed by the local clergy of the <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2h1cmNoX29mX1Rob3RoP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Church of Thoth (page does not exist)\">Church of Thoth</span>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p185_1-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p185-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p17_4-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p17-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-P&amp;P-p131_8-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-P&amp;P-p131-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Its rulers in the 14<sup>th</sup> century <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/DR\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>, as recommended to the vizier by the Thothian priesthood, were the Precept <a href=\"/wiki/Derlaunt\" title=\"Derlaunt\">Derlaunt</a> and the Divine Precept <a href=\"/wiki/Tholaunt\" title=\"Tholaunt\">Tholaunt</a>. The latter was an <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Incarnation\" title=\"Incarnation\">incarnation</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Thoth\" title=\"Thoth\">Thoth</a> and had the authority to overrule Derlaunt.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p20-21_6-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p20-21-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Seeing as Thoth was a god of knowledge, it was compulsory in Gheldaneth for all citizens to attend the city's university, even slaves.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p17_4-4\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p17-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-P&amp;P-p131_8-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-P&amp;P-p131-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trade\">Trade</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Trade\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Gheldaneth?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Trade\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The city imported various foods from the <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Vale\" title=\"Great Vale\">Great Vale</a>, which arrived either by land or sea, as well as miscellaneous good from <a href=\"/wiki/Unthalass\" title=\"Unthalass\">Unthalass</a> that came through its port facility.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p17_4-5\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p17-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Gheldaneth was also notably the primary source of <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Magic_item\" title=\"Magic item\">magic items</a> in Mulhorand.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p185_1-4\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p185-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Gheldaneth?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Following the Spellplague, the city's population was greatly reduced. By <a href=\"/wiki/1479_DR\" title=\"1479 DR\">1479 DR</a>, it had sworn fealty to <a href=\"/wiki/High_Imaskar\" title=\"High Imaskar\">High Imaskar</a> and the Imaskarians stationed troops in the city to ensure its loyalty.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p139_2-5\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p139-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Gheldaneth?veaction=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The city was home to many ethnic Mulhorandi who carried on many of their traditions. The city also housed many <a href=\"/wiki/Tiefling\" title=\"Tiefling\">tieflings</a>, descendants of slaves who made pacts with dark forces.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p139_2-6\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p139-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Locations\">Notable Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Gheldaneth?veaction=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Arcanum_of_Magic\" title=\"Arcanum of Magic\">Arcanum of Magic</a>, a university and temple dedicated to Thoth.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-P&amp;P-p131_8-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-P&amp;P-p131-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> It was the center of Thoth worship in the nation,<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-P&amp;P-p131_8-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-P&amp;P-p131-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p26_9-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p26-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> as well as the largest building in all of the city,<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p17_4-6\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p17-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> with its towering lining the northern wall. There the city's inhabitants learned how to count, read, write, and answer simple questions about both the <a href=\"/wiki/Mulhorandi_pantheon\" title=\"Mulhorandi pantheon\">Mulhorandi pantheon</a> and Mulhorand's history.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p17_4-7\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p17-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-P&amp;P-p131_8-4\"><a href=\"#cite_note-P&amp;P-p131-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li>A <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvV2l6YXJkX0NvbGxlZ2VfKEdoZWxkYW5ldGgpP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Wizard College (Gheldaneth) (page does not exist)\">wizard's college</span> that was adjacent to the Arcanum of Magic. It was the only place in Mulhorand besides <a href=\"/wiki/Skuld\" title=\"Skuld\">Skuld</a> where one could study <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">wizardry</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p18_3-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p18-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-P&amp;P-p131_8-5\"><a href=\"#cite_note-P&amp;P-p131-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li>The temple of <a href=\"/wiki/Horus-Re\" title=\"Horus-Re\">Horus-Re</a>: a ruined temple buried deep under the city.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p141_10-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p141-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li>A temple dedicated to <a href=\"/wiki/Isis\" title=\"Isis\">Isis</a>.</li>\n<li>A temple dedicated to <a href=\"/wiki/Nephthys\" title=\"Nephthys\">Nephthys</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Gheldaneth?veaction=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"metadata plainlinks stub\"><tbody><tr>\n<td><i>This article is incomplete.</i> <i>You can help the Forgotten Realms Wiki by providing more information.</i></td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><spa